SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Alistair Ogden
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:One of Canada’s top comedic talents\, Alistair Ogden first ap
 peared in the national spotlight when he won CBC’s Next Up Competition at
  age 23. Since then\, he’s brought his trademark witty and self-deprecati
 ng style of stand-up to televised sets for Canada’s Got Talent\, the Hali
 fax Comedy Festival\, and CBC’s New Wave of Stand Up. In the past year\, 
 he released his debut half-hour special Alistair Ogden Does His Best\, reco
 rded a set for Don’t Tell Comedy\, sold out shows across the country\, in
 cluding a headline hour at Just For Laughs: Vancouver\, and opened for Pete
  Holmes\, Hassan Phills\, Danae Hayes\, and Emma Willmann. His jokes have b
 een featured on CBC Radio’s Laugh Out Loud\, a Just For Laughs Originals 
 comedy album\, and have amassed over 20 million views and rising across Ins
 tagram\, TikTok\, and YouTube. Don’t miss your chance to see this up and 
 coming star!\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from ent
 ering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\
